| `make check-venv` `[local]` | Fails early, naming the pip command, when the venv lacks a requirement `pyproject.toml` declares for the gate; it is `make check-all`'s first prerequisite, and `make preflight` also runs its shared check before the gates. | `make check-venv` | [`venv.extras`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`transports.extras`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`PY`](settings.md#make-variables) | Judges installed versions, not whether the packages import. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
